# This directory holds the Rapfi engine binary, renamed to librapfi.so so that
# the Android build system treats it as a native library and places it in
# nativeLibraryDir — the only location where Android 10+ allows exec().
#
# Build scripts (tools/build_rapfi.cmd / .sh) place the binary here automatically.
# For the app to work without the engine, the built-in AI fallback is used.